 π: render_path⊢∅LLM∧∅net(published_crate=bar-observatory@crates.io); ∀𝒟:same_bytes_out∎

 ∴Δ⊗λ(ingest,ℛ)=3
 π: Post(ingest)={rows(𝒯)}≡Pre(ℛ); set-eq⇒⊆; [bind-zero]applies∎

 ∴∀A,B∈Ops:|{Δ⊗λ(A,B)}|≡1
 π: case[Γ:Binding]exhaustive(4)∧disjoint(first-match,fixed_order)∎

 ∴G12
 π: ⟦Ε⟧∈this_doc(see_below)⊢per_upstream:443∎

 ∴|HumanPrompt|≡68(¬69,¬87)
 π: 2_correction_rounds—R1:Ψ_synthetic⧵{"<task-notification>"}excluded(87→69); R2:excluded"session_continued"summaries(69→68); ∀excluded:role≡user∧block_type≡text∧∄human-authored; cross-checked∈Ε.E6∎
}

